@startuml
skinparam ActivityFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam Shadowing false
title Editing a student

start
:Parse the displayed index and at least one of
name, email, matriculation number, group or tags;
if (Arguments valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Report a parsing error;
    stop
endif

:Resolve the index in the displayed student list;
if (Index exists?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Report an invalid displayed index;
    stop
endif

:Create an immutable replacement student
from edited and unchanged fields;
if (Tutorial group changed?) then (yes)
    :Clear all attendance records
    from the replacement student;
else (no)
    :Preserve all attendance records;
endif

if (Replacement group is registered?) then (yes)
else (no)
    :Report an unknown group;
    stop
endif

if (Matriculation number belongs to another student?) then (yes)
    :Report a duplicate student;
    stop
else (no)
endif

if (Email belongs to another student?) then (yes)
    :Report a duplicate email;
    stop
else (no)
endif

:Replace the student in the full roster;
:Show all students, ordered by matriculation number;
:Save Roster and record the change for undo;
if (Tutorial group changed?) then (yes)
    :Report the old and new groups
    and number of cleared attendance records;
else (no)
    :Report the edited student;
endif
stop
@enduml
